    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "PRO-VS MINI Quick Start Guide",
      "notes": "MIDI controller table (page 86) read by tools/profiles/behringer/read-behringer-cc.mjs from QSG_BE_0722-ABF_PRO-VS-MINI_WW.pdf (sha256 4e57304cfece2dbb17c1312c4a57ebf302b2e2ad6df4ded05ced9adf2f8f2a91), https://cdn-media.empowertribe.com/07c681beb5724cb797eff24a67095bc7/QSG_BE_0722-ABF_PRO-VS-MINI_WW.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/behringer/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/behringer/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the guide's MIDI controller table, with its printed name, sent as a control change on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "Ranges are as printed (`0 - 99`): the guide does not say whether a range is the controller's values or what the panel shows for them.",
    "Rows the guide prints wrongly, given by the layout: CC 118 (printed Voice C Coarse Tuning, as 117 is: Voice D).",
    "Left out, the wheels, pedals, bank select, NRPN and RPN controllers and the channel mode messages: CC 1 Modulation."
  ],
